Found 2026-11-04 (huddle-orders research). docs/setup-guide.md:659-660 states an empty allow_channels/allow_users list means all, but src/slack_api.ml:31-40 and clawq_core.ml:648-653 treat empty as deny-all. Fix the doc (or the behaviour, deliberately) and add a test pinning the chosen semantics.